  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional pilot capacity building project to enhance North--South and South-South knowledge exchanges and cooperation on asylum and reception policies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective:
Establishing a pilot practical cooperation forum/working group/practitioners&#x2019; network for senior/policy officials from EU+ and RDPP NA countries (initially two, as specified above), with policy and decision-making responsibilities on matters related to asylum, reception and/or international protection of refugees and asylum seekers. Representatives from relevant international organisations will also be invited, as appropriate.</narrative>
  </description>
